AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P44_has_condition "имeeт условиe"@ru)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P44_has_condition "有状况"@zh)
InverseObjectProperties(crm:P44_has_condition crm:P44i_is_condition_of)
ObjectPropertyDomain(crm:P44_has_condition crm:E18_Physical_Thing)
ObjectPropertyRange(crm:P44_has_condition crm:E3_Condition_State)

# Object Property: crm:P45_consists_of (comprend)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment crm:P45_consists_of "This property identifies the instances of E57 Materials of which an instance of E18 Physical Thing is composed.
All physical things consist of physical materials. P45 consists of (is incorporated in) allows the different materials to be recorded. P45 consists of (is incorporated in) refers here to observed material as opposed to the consumed raw material.
A material, such as a theoretical alloy, may not have any physical instances."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "besteht aus"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "comprend"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "consiste de"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "consists of"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "αποτελείται από"@el)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "состоит из"@ru)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P45_consists_of "包含"@zh)
InverseObjectProperties(crm:P45_consists_of crm:P45i_is_incorporated_in)
ObjectPropertyRange(crm:P45_consists_of crm:E57_Material)

# Object Property: crm:P46_is_composed_of (est composé de)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment crm:P46_is_composed_of "This property associates an instance of E18 Physical Thing with another instance of Physical Thing that forms part of it. The spatial extent of the composing part is included in the spatial extent of the whole.
Component elements, since they are themselves instances of E18 Physical Thing, may be further analysed into sub-components, thereby creating a hierarchy of part decomposition. An instance of E18 Physical Thing may be shared between multiple wholes, for example two buildings may share a common wall. This property does not specify when and for how long a component element resided in the respective whole. If a component is not part of a whole from the beginning of existence or until the end of existence of the whole, the classes E79 Part Addition and E90 Part Removal can be used to document when a component became part of a particular whole and/or when it stopped being a part of it. For the time-span of being part of the respective whole, the component is completely contained in the place the whole occupies.
This property is intended to describe specific components that are individually documented, rather than general aspects. Overall descriptions of the structure of an instance of E18 Physical Thing are captured by the P3 has note property.
The instances of E57 Material of which an instance of E18 Physical Thing is composed should be documented using P45 consists of (is incorporated in).
This property is transitive and asymmetric."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "est composé de"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "is composed of"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "ist zusammengesetzt aus"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "é composto de"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "αποτελείται από"@el)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "составлeн из"@ru)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P46_is_composed_of "组成成分是"@zh)
InverseObjectProperties(crm:P46_is_composed_of crm:P46i_forms_part_of)
ObjectPropertyDomain(crm:P46_is_composed_of crm:E18_Physical_Thing)
ObjectPropertyRange(crm:P46_is_composed_of crm:E18_Physical_Thing)

# Object Property: crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier (έχει προτιμώμενο αναγνωριστικό)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "This property records the preferred instance of E42 Identifier that was used to identify an instance of E1 CRM Entity at the time this property was recorded.
More than one preferred identifier may have been assigned to an item over time.
Use of this property requires an external mechanism for assigning temporal validity to the respective CIDOC CRM instance.
The fact that an identifier is a preferred one for an organisation can be better expressed in a context independent form by assigning a suitable instance of E55 Type to the respective instance of E15 Identifier Assignment using the P2 has type property."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "a pour identifiant préférentiel"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "has preferred identifier"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "hat bevorzugtes Kennzeichen"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "tem identificador preferido"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "έχει προτιμώμενο αναγνωριστικό"@el)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "имeeт прeдпочтитeльный идeнтификатор"@ru)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier "有优选标识符"@zh)
SubObjectPropertyOf(crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier crm:P1_is_identified_by)
InverseObjectProperties(crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier crm:P48i_is_preferred_identifier_of)
ObjectPropertyDomain(crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier crm:E1_CRM_Entity)
ObjectPropertyRange(crm:P48_has_preferred_identifier crm:E42_Identifier)

# Object Property: crm:P4_has_time-span (发生时段是)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment crm:P4_has_time-span "This property associates an instance of E2 Temporal Entity with the instance of E52 Time-Span during which it was on-going. The associated instance of E52 Time-Span is understood as the real time-span during which the phenomena making up the temporal entity instance were active. More than one instance of E2 Temporal Entity may share a common instance of E52 Time-Span only if they come into being and end being due to identical declarations or events."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "a pour intervalle temporel"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "has time-span"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "hat Zeitspanne"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "tem período de tempo"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "βρισκόταν σε εξέλιξη"@el)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "имeeт врeмeнной интeрвал"@ru)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P4_has_time-span "发生时段是"@zh)
