# Data Property: crm:P82_at_some_time_within (最长范围是)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment crm:P82_at_some_time_within "This property describes the maximum period of time within which an E52 Time-Span falls. Since Time-Spans may not have precisely known temporal extents, the CIDOC CRM supports statements about the minimum and maximum temporal extents of Time-Spans. This property allows a Time-Span’s maximum temporal extent (i.e. its outer boundary) to be assigned an E61 Time Primitive value. Time Primitives are treated by the CIDOC CRM as application or system specific date intervals, and are not further analysed. If different sources of evidence justify different maximum extents without contradicting each other, the resulting intersection of all these extents will be the best estimate. This should be taken into account for information integration."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "a eu lieu durant"@fr)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "abrange no máximo"@pt)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "at some time within"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "irgendwann innerhalb von"@de)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "κάποτε εντός"@el)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "в тeчeниe пeриода врeмeни"@ru)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label crm:P82_at_some_time_within "最长范围是"@zh)
DataPropertyDomain(crm:P82_at_some_time_within crm:E52_Time-Span)
DataPropertyRange(crm:P82_at_some_time_within xsd:dateTime)

# Data Property: crm:P82a_begin_of_the_begin (début du début)

